    "text": "If the sum of the first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> terms of the series <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math> is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>225</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, then <math><mi>K</mi></math> is equal to :"
