  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given series,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mn>15</mn></math> terms</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>64</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>64</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>225</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>225</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Since, given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>225</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>225</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p>"
